"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/icons","line":29},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":29},{"title":"An illustration that represents the Weather app highlighted to show a page control at the bottom edge of the screen. The page control displays a mix of icons, such as weak sun, cloud, cloud with sun, and cloud with drizzle.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/671a959d0a2a6baf234fcc2255b9abdb/page-indicator-customization-incorrect%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate an incorrect example.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":37,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that represents the Weather app highlighted to show a page control at the bottom edge of the screen. The page control displays the location symbol on the leading side followed by a series of dots.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b797a18ec978a588e29113b3a9f522b7/page-indicator-customization-correct%402x.png","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate a correct example.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#Platform-considerations","line":45},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#iOS-iPadOS","line":49},{"title":"An illustration of a page control. The page control displays a total of 9 dots. The center 5 dots use the default size; the second and eighth dots are about half the default size and the first and ninth dots are about one quarter the default size. The center dot is filled, indicating the location of the current page in the list.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6413d2970c5a12e6374d83bed419293c/page-controls-many-indicators%402x.png","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"`UIPageControl.InteractionState`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIPageControl/InteractionState-swift.enum","line":59},{"title":"`backgroundStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIPageControl/backgroundStyle-swift.property","line":74},{"title":"tvOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#tvOS","line":78},{"title":"visionOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#visionOS","line":82},{"title":"watchOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#watchOS","line":86},{"title":"tab view","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/components/layout-and-organization/tab-views","line":88},{"title":"An illustration representing a screen that includes a vertical tab view on Apple Watch. A page control next to the Digital Crown shows that the fourth tab is currently selected.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d8ac19e2578c57035e74fe697a15d573/page-controls-watch-vertical%402x.png","line":90,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration representing a screen that includes a horizontal tab view on Apple Watch. A page control at the bottom shows that the second tab is currently selected.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0f915ec7b0e8755a2d60845617746f71/page-controls-watch-horizontal%402x.png","line":94,"embedded":true},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#Resources","line":102},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/page-controls#Related","line":104},{"title":"Scroll views","target":"https://dev